ishtaria-datadisk-gilgamesh (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release of the Epic of Gilgamesh datadisk
  * Complete epic questline from Gilgamesh's tyranny to his return
  * All major characters: Gilgamesh, Enkidu, Ishtar, Shamhat, Humbaba, Utnapishtim
  * Main locations: Uruk, Cedar Forest, Mount Mashu, Waters of Death
  * English and Czech translations
  * Voice synthesis configuration for all NPCs

